  "notes": [
    "Both resets count: the oracle slot mapping fUSD to the USDC/USD aggregator and the comptroller's 0.85 scFUSD collateral factor set minutes later. fUSD already traded below par in late 2021, but no new fUSD was supplied from Oct 2021 until the first atomic swap-supply-borrow loop of May 12, 2022 (the anchor).",
    "Campaign: every non-fUSD borrow by the ten accounts that first supplied fUSD between May 12 and the May 20 feed change, each borrowing ~85% of supplied fUSD at $1 against a ~$0.70 market. Pre-existing 2021 fUSD positions and the DEI leg (DEI near $0.98 when supplied) are not attributed.",
    "Gross borrows, not net of liquidations (rule 14); the attackers' own repayments (1,061,436.78 USDC, 118.36 WBTC) are offset as round trips. Bridged WETH is priced as ETH and USDC/DAI at par, as DefiLlama lacks Fantom history for them."
  ]
